    "text": "Vertexa Solutions Pvt. Ltd.",
    "start_offset": 0,
    "end_offset": 27,
    "doc_char_start": 60,
    "doc_char_end": 87
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 2,
    "paragraph_id": 2,
    "page": 1,
    "text": "Mini Company Handbook -Employee Reference Edition, v4.2",
    "start_offset": 0,
    "end_offset": 55,
    "doc_char_start": 89,
    "doc_char_end": 144
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 3,
    "paragraph_id": 3,
    "page": 1,
    "text": "Internal Use Only.",
    "start_offset": 0,
    "end_offset": 18,
    "doc_char_start": 146,
    "doc_char_end": 164
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 4,
    "paragraph_id": 3,
    "page": 1,
    "text": "If in doubt, check with there reporting manager before acting on any policy below.",
    "start_offset": 19,
    "end_offset": 101,
    "doc_char_start": 165,
    "doc_char_end": 247
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 5,
    "paragraph_id": 4,
    "page": 1,
    "text": "1 Company Overview",
    "start_offset": 0,
    "end_offset": 18,
    "doc_char_start": 249,
    "doc_char_end": 267
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 6,
    "paragraph_id": 5,
    "page": 1,
    "text": "1.1 History | 1.2 Mission | 1.3 Vision | 1.4 Values",
    "start_offset": 0,
    "end_offset": 51,
    "doc_char_start": 269,
    "doc_char_end": 320
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 7,
    "paragraph_id": 6,
    "page": 1,
    "text": "Vertexa Solutions Pvt. Ltd. was founded in 2011 by six engineers who set out to build tools that helps enterprises make sense of unstructured documents.",
    "start_offset": 0,
    "end_offset": 152,
    "doc_char_start": 322,
    "doc_char_end": 474
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 8,
    "paragraph_id": 6,
    "page": 1,
    "text": "The company was incorporated in Bengaluru; it's first office was a two-room facility above a printing shop.",
    "start_offset": 153,
    "end_offset": 260,
    "doc_char_start": 475,
    "doc_char_end": 582
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 9,
    "paragraph_id": 6,
    "page": 1,
    "text": "Vertexa now serves over 300 clients accross 14 countries.",
    "start_offset": 261,
    "end_offset": 318,
    "doc_char_start": 583,
    "doc_char_end": 640
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 10,
    "paragraph_id": 7,
    "page": 1,
    "text": "Note: Section 9 (Compliance) references a founding year of 2009 in a regulatory filing summary, though 2011 is the year on official incorporation records.",
    "start_offset": 0,
    "end_offset": 154,
    "doc_char_start": 642,
    "doc_char_end": 796
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 11,
    "paragraph_id": 8,
    "page": 1,
    "text": "Mission: to help organizations unlock the value trapped in there documents by combining rigorous engineering with respect for the people who rely on our software everyday.",
    "start_offset": 0,
    "end_offset": 171,
    "doc_char_start": 798,
    "doc_char_end": 969
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 12,
    "paragraph_id": 9,
    "page": 1,
    "text": "Vision: a future in which no employee ever has to manually search hundreds of pages to find a single fact.",
    "start_offset": 0,
    "end_offset": 106,
    "doc_char_start": 971,
    "doc_char_end": 1077
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 13,
    "paragraph_id": 10,
    "page": 1,
    "text": "Customer Obsession -we start with the customer's problem.",
    "start_offset": 0,
    "end_offset": 57,
    "doc_char_start": 1079,
    "doc_char_end": 1136
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 14,
    "paragraph_id": 11,
    "page": 1,
    "text": "Ownership -every employee fixes what they see is broken.",
    "start_offset": 0,
    "end_offset": 56,
    "doc_char_start": 1138,
    "doc_char_end": 1194
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 15,
    "paragraph_id": 12,
    "page": 1,
    "text": "Integrity -we do the right thing even when its inconvenient.",
    "start_offset": 0,
    "end_offset": 60,
    "doc_char_start": 1196,
    "doc_char_end": 1256
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 16,
    "paragraph_id": 13,
    "page": 1,
    "text": "Curiosity -we treat contradictions as learning opportunities.",
    "start_offset": 0,
    "end_offset": 61,
    "doc_char_start": 1258,
    "doc_char_end": 1319
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 17,
    "paragraph_id": 14,
    "page": 1,
    "text": "These four values were ratified in 2012; a 2019 internal memo claims a fifth value, 'Simplicity', was added that year -HR maintains the values have been constant since 2012.",
    "start_offset": 0,
    "end_offset": 173,
    "doc_char_start": 1321,
    "doc_char_end": 1494
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 18,
    "paragraph_id": 15,
    "page": 1,
    "text": "2 Human Resources Policies",
    "start_offset": 0,
    "end_offset": 26,
    "doc_char_start": 1496,
    "doc_char_end": 1522
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 19,
    "paragraph_id": 16,
    "page": 1,
    "text": "2.1 Leave Policy | 2.2 Attendance | 2.3 Code of Conduct",
    "start_offset": 0,
    "end_offset": 55,
    "doc_char_start": 1524,
    "doc_char_end": 1579
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 20,
    "paragraph_id": 17,
    "page": 1,
    "text": "Page 4 of the original policy circular: Employees receive 18 annual leaves per calendar year, credited pro-rata for employees joining mid-year, plus 10 sick and 5 casual leaves.",
    "start_offset": 0,
    "end_offset": 177,
    "doc_char_start": 1581,
    "doc_char_end": 1758
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 21,
    "paragraph_id": 18,
    "page": 1,
    "text": "Page 18 of the same circular (Annexure update): Employees receive 20 annual leaves per calendar year following the FY23 revision.",
    "start_offset": 0,
    "end_offset": 129,
    "doc_char_start": 1760,
    "doc_char_end": 1889
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 22,
    "paragraph_id": 19,
    "page": 1,
    "text": "Standard hours are 9:30 AM -6:30 PM.",
    "start_offset": 0,
    "end_offset": 36,
    "doc_char_start": 1891,
    "doc_char_end": 1927
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 23,
    "paragraph_id": 19,
    "page": 1,
    "text": "Repeated unexplained absences may effect an employee's rating.",
    "start_offset": 37,
    "end_offset": 99,
    "doc_char_start": 1928,
    "doc_char_end": 1990
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 24,
    "paragraph_id": 19,
    "page": 1,
    "text": "Employees who's conduct",
    "start_offset": 100,
    "end_offset": 123,
    "doc_char_start": 1991,
    "doc_char_end": 2014
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 25,
    "paragraph_id": 20,
    "page": 1,
    "text": "violates the Code of Conduct may face disciplinary action; their are no exceptions based on seniority.",
    "start_offset": 0,
    "end_offset": 102,
    "doc_char_start": 2016,
    "doc_char_end": 2118
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 26,
    "paragraph_id": 21,
    "page": 1,
    "text": "3 Work From Home",
    "start_offset": 0,
    "end_offset": 16,
    "doc_char_start": 2120,
    "doc_char_end": 2136
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 27,
    "paragraph_id": 22,
    "page": 1,
    "text": "Page 6: Employees may work remotely three days every week, subject to manager approval.",
    "start_offset": 0,
    "end_offset": 87,
    "doc_char_start": 2138,
    "doc_char_end": 2225
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 28,
    "paragraph_id": 23,
    "page": 1,
    "text": "Page 25 (FY24 operating-model update): Employees are expected to work from office full time, effective the date communicated by department heads -this supersedes informal remote arrangements.",
    "start_offset": 0,
    "end_offset": 191,
    "doc_char_start": 2227,
    "doc_char_end": 2418
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 29,
    "paragraph_id": 23,
    "page": 1,
    "text": "It is not stated in this handbook which of the two rules governs in case of conflict.",
    "start_offset": 192,
    "end_offset": 277,
    "doc_char_start": 2419,
    "doc_char_end": 2504
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 30,
    "paragraph_id": 24,
    "page": 1,
    "text": "4 Travel Policy",
    "start_offset": 0,
    "end_offset": 15,
    "doc_char_start": 2506,
    "doc_char_end": 2521
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 31,
    "paragraph_id": 25,
    "page": 1,
    "text": "Travel should be approved whenever necessary -the policy does not specify who decides necessity, or according to whose judgement a trip qualifies.",
    "start_offset": 0,
    "end_offset": 146,
    "doc_char_start": 2523,
    "doc_char_end": 2669
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 32,
    "paragraph_id": 25,
    "page": 1,
    "text": "International travel needs ~4 weeks",
    "start_offset": 147,
    "end_offset": 182,
    "doc_char_start": 2670,
    "doc_char_end": 2705
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 33,
    "paragraph_id": 25,
    "page": 1,
    "text": "lead time for visa processing; travel insurance is mandatory.",
    "start_offset": 183,
    "end_offset": 244,
    "doc_char_start": 2706,
    "doc_char_end": 2767
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 34,
    "paragraph_id": 25,
    "page": 1,
    "text": "Employees below a certain grade may need additional sign-off, though the grade threshold is undefined here.",
    "start_offset": 245,
    "end_offset": 352,
    "doc_char_start": 2768,
    "doc_char_end": 2875
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 35,
    "paragraph_id": 26,
    "page": 1,
    "text": "5 IT Security",
    "start_offset": 0,
    "end_offset": 13,
    "doc_char_start": 2877,
    "doc_char_end": 2890
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 36,
    "paragraph_id": 27,
    "page": 1,
    "text": "Password Policy | MFA | VPN | Device Encryption | USB Policy",
    "start_offset": 0,
    "end_offset": 60,
    "doc_char_start": 2892,
    "doc_char_end": 2952
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 37,
    "paragraph_id": 28,
    "page": 1,
    "text": "Passwords: atleast 12 characters, mixed case + numeric + special, rotated every 90 days.",
    "start_offset": 0,
    "end_offset": 88,
    "doc_char_start": 2954,
    "doc_char_end": 3042
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 38,
    "paragraph_id": 29,
    "page": 1,
    "text": "MFA is mandatory for email, VPN, and internal apps within 48 hours of access being granted.",
    "start_offset": 0,
    "end_offset": 91,
    "doc_char_start": 3044,
    "doc_char_end": 3135
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 39,
    "paragraph_id": 30,
    "page": 1,
    "text": "VPN required for all off-network access; split tunneling disabled by default.",
    "start_offset": 0,
    "end_offset": 77,
    "doc_char_start": 3137,
    "doc_char_end": 3214
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 40,
    "paragraph_id": 31,
    "page": 1,
    "text": "Full-disk encryption mandatory on all company laptops.",
    "start_offset": 0,
    "end_offset": 54,
    "doc_char_start": 3216,
    "doc_char_end": 3270
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 41,
    "paragraph_id": 32,
    "page": 1,
    "text": "Personal USB drives are prohibited unless approved by IT Security; see Appendix B for data-handling obligations on removable media.",
    "start_offset": 0,
    "end_offset": 131,
    "doc_char_start": 3272,
    "doc_char_end": 3403
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 42,
    "paragraph_id": 33,
    "page": 1,
    "text": "6 Finance",
    "start_offset": 0,
    "end_offset": 9,
    "doc_char_start": 3405,
    "doc_char_end": 3414
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 43,
    "paragraph_id": 34,
    "page": 1,
    "text": "Quarterly revenue and YoY growth (FY24), as reported to the Board:",
    "start_offset": 0,
    "end_offset": 66,
    "doc_char_start": 3416,
    "doc_char_end": 3482
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 44,
    "paragraph_id": 35,
    "page": 1,
    "text": "Elsewhere in the same board deck, Q1 FY24 YoY growth is separately reported as 15% rather than the 18% shown in Table 1 above -the discrepancy has not been reconciled in this edition.",
    "start_offset": 0,
    "end_offset": 183,
    "doc_char_start": 3484,
    "doc_char_end": 3667
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 45,
    "paragraph_id": 36,
    "page": 1,
    "text": "7 Product Documentation",
    "start_offset": 0,
    "end_offset": 23,
    "doc_char_start": 3669,
    "doc_char_end": 3692
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 46,
    "paragraph_id": 37,
    "page": 1,
    "text": "The platform (see Fig. 1) is organized into four layers: Presentation, AI Platform/API, Processing, and Data.",
    "start_offset": 0,
    "end_offset": 109,
    "doc_char_start": 3694,
    "doc_char_end": 3803
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 47,
    "paragraph_id": 37,
    "page": 1,
    "text": "Core modules:",
    "start_offset": 110,
    "end_offset": 123,
    "doc_char_start": 3804,
    "doc_char_end": 3817
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 48,
    "paragraph_id": 38,
    "page": 1,
    "text": "8 Customer Support",
    "start_offset": 0,
    "end_offset": 18,
    "doc_char_start": 3819,
    "doc_char_end": 3837
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 49,
    "paragraph_id": 39,
    "page": 1,
    "text": "Escalation note: Alex informed Jordan that he would contact the customer directly to confirm the resolution timeline before the ticket is closed.",
    "start_offset": 0,
    "end_offset": 145,
    "doc_char_start": 3839,
    "doc_char_end": 3984
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 50,
    "paragraph_id": 40,
    "page": 1,
    "text": "Standard SLA is first response within 4 business hours for Tier 1 tickets.",
    "start_offset": 0,
    "end_offset": 74,
    "doc_char_start": 3986,
    "doc_char_end": 4060
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 51,
    "paragraph_id": 41,
    "page": 1,
    "text": "9 Compliance",
    "start_offset": 0,
    "end_offset": 12,
    "doc_char_start": 4062,
    "doc_char_end": 4074
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 52,
    "paragraph_id": 42,
    "page": 1,
    "text": "Vertexa's data protection obligations are summarized here; for the full clause list and retention schedule, see Appendix B. Audit findings are reviewed quarterly by the Compliance Committee.",
    "start_offset": 0,
    "end_offset": 190,
    "doc_char_start": 4076,
    "doc_char_end": 4266
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 53,
    "paragraph_id": 43,
    "page": 1,
    "text": "10 Disaster Recovery",
    "start_offset": 0,
    "end_offset": 20,
    "doc_char_start": 4268,
    "doc_char_end": 4288
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 54,
    "paragraph_id": 44,
    "page": 1,
    "text": "Recovery Time Objective (RTO), per the DR runbook summary: critical systems must be restored within 4 hours of a declared incident.",
    "start_offset": 0,
    "end_offset": 131,
    "doc_char_start": 4290,
    "doc_char_end": 4421
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 55,
    "paragraph_id": 45,
    "page": 1,
    "text": "Later in the same runbook (Section 10.3, Extended Scenarios): recovery of the same critical systems is instead targeted within 12 hours for a 'major' incident -the threshold distinguishing a standard incident from a 'major' one is not defined.",
    "start_offset": 0,
    "end_offset": 243,
    "doc_char_start": 4423,
    "doc_char_end": 4666
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 56,
    "paragraph_id": 46,
    "page": 1,
    "text": "11 Technical Architecture",
    "start_offset": 0,
    "end_offset": 25,
    "doc_char_start": 4668,
    "doc_char_end": 4693
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 57,
    "paragraph_id": 47,
    "page": 1,
    "text": "Vertexa's AI Platform (also referred to elsewhere in this handbook as the AI Engine, the Artificial Intelligence Platform, and the AI Solution) underpins Document AI, RAG retrieval, and the Auth Gateway shown in Fig.",
    "start_offset": 0,
    "end_offset": 216,
    "doc_char_start": 4695,
    "doc_char_end": 4911
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 58,
    "paragraph_id": 47,
    "page": 1,
    "text": "1.",
    "start_offset": 217,
    "end_offset": 219,
    "doc_char_start": 4912,
    "doc_char_end": 4914
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 59,
    "paragraph_id": 48,
    "page": 1,
    "text": "12 Procurement",
    "start_offset": 0,
    "end_offset": 14,
    "doc_char_start": 4916,
    "doc_char_end": 4930
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 60,
    "paragraph_id": 49,
    "page": 1,
    "text": "Purchase approval steps:",
    "start_offset": 0,
    "end_offset": 24,
    "doc_char_start": 4932,
    "doc_char_end": 4956
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 61,
    "paragraph_id": 50,
    "page": 1,
    "text": "1. Raise a purchase requisition in the procurement portal.",
    "start_offset": 0,
    "end_offset": 58,
    "doc_char_start": 4958,
    "doc_char_end": 5016
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 62,
    "paragraph_id": 51,
    "page": 1,
    "text": "2. Obtain budget sign-off from the department head.",
    "start_offset": 0,
    "end_offset": 51,
    "doc_char_start": 5018,
    "doc_char_end": 5069
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 63,
    "paragraph_id": 52,
    "page": 1,
    "text": "3. Finance issues a purchase order to the approved vendor.",
    "start_offset": 0,
    "end_offset": 58,
    "doc_char_start": 5071,
    "doc_char_end": 5129
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 64,
    "paragraph_id": 53,
    "page": 1,
    "text": "4.",
    "start_offset": 0,
    "end_offset": 2,
    "doc_char_start": 5131,
    "doc_char_end": 5133
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 65,
    "paragraph_id": 53,
    "page": 1,
    "text": "Goods/services are received and matched against the PO before payment.",
    "start_offset": 3,
    "end_offset": 73,
    "doc_char_start": 5134,
    "doc_char_end": 5204
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 66,
    "paragraph_id": 54,
    "page": 1,
    "text": "13 Employee Benefits",
    "start_offset": 0,
    "end_offset": 20,
    "doc_char_start": 5206,
    "doc_char_end": 5226
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 67,
    "paragraph_id": 55,
    "page": 1,
    "text": "Per the Benefits Guide: Health insurance coverage begins after 30 days of continuous employment.",
    "start_offset": 0,
    "end_offset": 96,
    "doc_char_start": 5228,
    "doc_char_end": 5324
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 68,
    "paragraph_id": 56,
    "page": 1,
    "text": "Per the updated Total Rewards page circulated separately: health insurance coverage begins after 90 days of continuous employment -the two documents have not been reconciled.",
    "start_offset": 0,
    "end_offset": 174,
    "doc_char_start": 5326,
    "doc_char_end": 5500
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 69,
    "paragraph_id": 57,
    "page": 1,
    "text": "14 Legal",
    "start_offset": 0,
    "end_offset": 8,
    "doc_char_start": 5502,
    "doc_char_end": 5510
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 70,
    "paragraph_id": 58,
    "page": 1,
    "text": "Definitions used across this handbook include 'Confidential Information', 'Business Day', and 'Force Majeure Event'; a formal definition of 'Business Day' is not provided in this edition and should be read as per the employment contract.",
    "start_offset": 0,
    "end_offset": 237,
    "doc_char_start": 5512,
    "doc_char_end": 5749
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 71,
    "paragraph_id": 59,
    "page": 1,
    "text": "15 Frequently Asked Questions",
    "start_offset": 0,
    "end_offset": 29,
    "doc_char_start": 5751,
    "doc_char_end": 5780
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 72,
    "paragraph_id": 60,
    "page": 1,
    "text": "How many annual leaves do employees receive?",
    "start_offset": 0,
    "end_offset": 44,
    "doc_char_start": 5782,
    "doc_char_end": 5826
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 73,
    "paragraph_id": 60,
    "page": 1,
    "text": "-See",
    "start_offset": 45,
    "end_offset": 49,
    "doc_char_start": 5827,
    "doc_char_end": 5831
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 74,
    "paragraph_id": 60,
    "page": 1,
    "text": "Section 2.1 (18 vs. 20 -unresolved).",
    "start_offset": 50,
    "end_offset": 86,
    "doc_char_start": 5832,
    "doc_char_end": 5868
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 75,
    "paragraph_id": 61,
    "page": 1,
    "text": "Is MFA mandatory?",
    "start_offset": 0,
    "end_offset": 17,
    "doc_char_start": 5870,
    "doc_char_end": 5887
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 76,
    "paragraph_id": 61,
    "page": 1,
    "text": "-Yes, for all employees (Section 5.2).",
    "start_offset": 18,
    "end_offset": 56,
    "doc_char_start": 5888,
    "doc_char_end": 5926
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 77,
    "paragraph_id": 62,
    "page": 1,
    "text": "What was Q1 revenue growth?",
    "start_offset": 0,
    "end_offset": 27,
    "doc_char_start": 5928,
    "doc_char_end": 5955
  },
  {
    "sentence_id": 78,
    "paragraph_id": 62,
    "page": 1,
    "text": "-Reported as both 18% and 15% (Section 6).",
    "start_offset": 28,
